Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've stolen my Egyptian god card,\Nwhy don't you try to use it against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the winged dragon of Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow the dragon is locked inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, somehow Mai's got to set it\Nfree and fast so she can end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I know how to tap the power\Nof the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe for now, but soon I'll learn\Nto control its unstoppable force.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you this isn't a mere duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're playing a shadow game with\Nancient magic beyond your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only am I erasing your memory\Nwith every monster I destroy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but once you lose this battle to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,your mind will be trapped here,\Nconfined in isolation for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't let this nut win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, as for my Egyptian God card, you were\Na fool to think you'd be able to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:02:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Only individuals with knowledge of the\Nancient scriptures can wield the power of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just jealous because you lost your\NEgyptian God card to a better duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna use it to\Nknock you out of the finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your winged dragon answers to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you try reading the ancient\Ntext written on the bottom of the card?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the ancient chant,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,used to call upon the hidden\Npowers of the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't remember seeing that\Nwriting when the card was in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is this another one\Nof Merrick's mind tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.73,0:02:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you try reading the chant?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you're in need of a lesson in\Nthe ancient Egyptian scriptures, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got me trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't I read the\Nchant and regain control of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick recites the ancient\Nwords, the dragon will obey him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, what do you think it says?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Photograph the card with\Nour satellite camera
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and use the onboard network\Nto translate it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome idea, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get on it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon that card will be mine,\Nand I must know its secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stare at that card all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.33,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never decipher the\Nancient words printed upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's written in a special\Nform of hieroglyphic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,script used only by high-ranking\Nindividuals in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I doubt you fit that category.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my family does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They guard the pharaohs, too. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Kaiba could read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he mean? In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,several people on this vessel\Ncan trace their history back to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,ancient Egypt to a time when\Nsorcerers and kings waged great wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, the power of\Nthe shadows was everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and the world feared\Nthose who controlled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.83,0:04:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a history lesson to learn how
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to control the actions of my duel monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus certainly did,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.19,0:04:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and not even he knew how to decipher the\Nancient text when he created the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But he knew that in ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the winged dragon would only\Nobey those who chanted the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So Pegasus printed the\Nwords in an ink that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,can only be seen when\Nthe monster is summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Merrick knew all along that\NI'd never be able to use that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.15,0:04:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you reading the chant?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Or shall I release the\Nwinged dragon of Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance, foolish girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me how you control an Egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it up, Psycho Boy.\NBe careful, a man with no
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,other monsters on the field\Nif my gets attacked by that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,winged dragon it's over\Nmaric must have planned
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,this from the beginning he\Nwanted my to take his card
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:05:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,this is getting interesting\Nif my can't recite the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,text printed on the winged\Ndragon of ra she can't use
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it then when it's maric's\Nmove he'll have a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to recite the chant and\Nregain control of the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once those words are spoken,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the Egyptian god monster will unlock\Nitself from that sphere and attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll finally get to see how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out, my\Ndear, so make your move,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,unless you're willing to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you have no monsters on\Nthe field to protect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and that means I can use my Egyptian\Ngod card to attack your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.99,0:05:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare to lose and live an\Neternity of loneliness and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your final opportunity to\Nawaken the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap card, Gravity\NBind, will protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:06:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once activated, it stops the\Nattack of any powerful monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So whether Merrick uses his holding\Narms or awakens the Winged Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Holding Legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry, my dear, but say goodbye\Nto that face-down card now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For when it's summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Holding Legs sends every magic and\Ntrap card back to the player's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And when played alongside Holding Arms,\Nthis card has another special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It calls forth the sacred stone of Uja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, with no monsters, I'm able to\Nattack your life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So be prepared to lose\Neverything right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go holding arms and holding legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.09,0:06:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of hologram is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said that was a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.99,0:07:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are playing a shadow\Ngame, or don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.91,0:07:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens here is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack her life points at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice, it sounds so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, your friends are all gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you intruding\Non my shadow game again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I will duel soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And things are beginning\Nto get interesting up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For it's time to awaken\Nthe winged dragon of Ra
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,by reciting the ancient\Nchant and reclaiming my great
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,beast so I can finish this\Nduel once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:08:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick gets control of that thing,\NMai's gonna be in major trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.73,0:08:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Great beast of the sky,\Nplease hear my cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform myself from orb of light\Nand bring me victory in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's chant is awakening\Nthe Egyptian god monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the beast belongs to him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Envelop the desert with your glow\Nand cast your rage upon my bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlock your powers from deep\Nwithin, so that together we may win!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Appear in this shadow\Ngame, as I call your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.23,0:08:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, my great beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The most powerful of all\Nthe Egyptian god monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:09:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time now to end this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick attacks with\Nthe Winged Dragon of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai will lose the rest of her life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and she'll be trapped in\Nthe Shadow Realm forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a pity it has to\Nend like this, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind is a mere shadow of its former\Nself, and it's growing even dimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and chained to that stone,\Nyou can't reach your deck. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as my monster attacks,\Nyour world will crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.03,0:09:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, we gotta stop\Nthis. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave Mai alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grudge is against me, not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, Pharaoh, but I'm\Njust having a little fun up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I like more than\Ntoying with someone's mind, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll face each other soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something I've been\Nwaiting for since my family
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,insisted I bear the ancient\Nscriptures on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed to carry the secret of the\Npharaoh's power until his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.57,0:10:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh's secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And although this duty has brought\Ngreat honor to the Ishtar name,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it has brought me nothing but\Ngreat suffering and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations, my family has waited\Nhopelessly for the pharaoh's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for me, serving\Nthe ancient Pharaoh is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,a game for fools giving\Nup my life just to play
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,servant to a 5 000 year\Nold king when all along
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,i hold the key to his\Ngreat power i shall become
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.61,0:10:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the king i have to figure\Nout the secret britain
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,on merrick's back i\Nalways knew i was destined
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,For greatness. I just\Nneed to collect all the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,right pieces so i can\Nput together my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,this madness has to stop understand right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,now this madness has just begun tormenting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:11:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,your little friend's mind up here is\Nmerely practice more soon you shall suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,While the world finally\Npowers in fear before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This shadow game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to trap your\Nmind in the shadows forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Chewie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop that freak\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.11,0:11:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rat, pull the plug on this stool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's in violation of Battle City rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be disqualified. Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well put, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to feel the rage of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra, direct attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that voice. Who is it?\NBig Brother! Please be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to her all you want, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll never remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, butch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound so familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you just gotta\Nremember who I am, my. Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.29,0:12:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.55,0:12:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look in my eyes. It's me,\NJoey? That's right. It's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not going to let anything happen\Nto you, Mai, because we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.07,0:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends? Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm always here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I got something I gotta tell you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that I should\Nhave told you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when I got knocked\Nunconscious during that lightning storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.85,0:13:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I had that freaky dream\Nthat we were all back at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,only for some reason I couldn't stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, little help, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, all my friends helped\Nme get back on my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Including you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I told you that you\Nweren't in that dream, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, you remember now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.55,0:13:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The meddling fool broke my shadow spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy them both now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me out of these stupid chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's the Mai I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, this thing's on\Neven tighter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.63,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get it off quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joey does think of me\Nas a friend after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that knucklehead liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about me. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:13:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, wake the dragon up. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Joey, don't be a hero. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the nicest thing\Nanyone's ever done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.59,0:14:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be okay, Mai. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I never break a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't that special?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears I'll be able to destroy Yugi\Neven sooner than I thought I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dark shadow powers\Nwill never penetrate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I will shield everyone from your evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing can withstand the unstoppable\Nforce of the greatest creature to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever walk the earth. The Winged Dragon\Nof Ra, all three of you are finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,oh no yuki help him please get off don't\Nworry yuke you're gonna be all right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think, fool,\Nbut I'm afraid I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I won this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Her life points are gone, so announce\Nme as the winner immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this duel is Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick Ishtam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check the damage\Nand cause some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, come on. Get up, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I should send him to the\NShadow Realm right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, I still need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not so fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:16:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And you need to be taught a lesson about\Nmeddling in matters that don't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This should hold you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps next time you'll think\Nbefore you enter a duel uninvited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to him, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine, but there's\Nsomething we need to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have my Egyptian god card\Nin your deck, and I want it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.07,0:16:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to fulfill my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I said if you lost, you'd be trapped\Nin the Shadow Realm for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your memory has failed you,\Nbut you and I had an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, guys, because here come\Nthe wheelies. Come on, get in! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream all you want, they can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But they seem to be having fun, and\Nthey don't miss you at all, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now are you beginning to\Nunderstand where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sort of a living nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be completely alone\Nfor the rest of eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And here you'll sit day\Nafter day in isolation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.13,0:17:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,as your friends disappear one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy your\Nstay in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking back my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, don't leave me\Nhere. Later. No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did to her now, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend made a costly\Nmistake by dueling against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:18:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm afraid she's\Npaying the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Notice her motionless appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because her mind is trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,With each passing\Nsecond, she forgets more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows are taking\Neverything, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.91,0:18:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Her family, her friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,everything she kept inside\Nher mind and inside her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now put him up, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, threaten me again and you'll\Nmeet the same fate as your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, please, just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This creep's psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the power within me growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With each mind I send to the shadows,\Nthe darkness within me increases.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mai, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you've got to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:19:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I let you down, Mai, but I promise\NI'm going to get you out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, Yugi's waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.61,0:19:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you and Mai okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.45,0:19:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mai's not doing so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.41,0:19:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek pulled something freaky\Nwith that Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he trapped her\Nbrain in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and then he said she's\Ngonna lose all her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more written on this\Ncard than just that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.43,0:19:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll decode the text right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find out all\Nthe secrets of this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you geeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the field for the next duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.53,0:19:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling next, and I need\Nto prepare the field, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So that the torment can begin.
